==Vietnamese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*krawʔ}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|khau}}, {{cog|mnw|တြဴ}}. <!-- I'm a bit skeptical of this root as this is pretty much a Monic-Vietic isogloss, although the match is pretty much perfect. --->

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{ltc-l|牢}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lao}}) and {{ltc-l|娄}}, alternative form {{ltc-l|婁|id=2}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lâu}}).

